    "text": "Twin Falls\nMan dies after motorcycle crash on I-84 near Twin Falls\n3 hours ago\nBOISE, Idaho — One man is dead after a two-vehicle crash on Interstate 84 east of Twin Falls late Wednesday morning, Idaho State Police reported. Police said a 63-year-old man from Eagen, Minnesota, was driving west on a 2019 Harley-Davidson motorcycle on I-84 when he hit a 2025 Western Star semi-truck pulling two trailers as traffic began to slow.",
